   "texts": {
    "Route104_Text_1C55B9": "If you see BERRIES growing in loamy\\nsoil, feel free to take them.\\pBut make sure you plant a BERRY in the\\nsame spot. That's common courtesy.\\pHere, I'll share this with you.$",
