   "script": "Route104_EventScript_14EF09",
   "texts": {
    "Route104_Text_16DD91": "This FLOWER SHOP started selling\\nsaplings recently.\\pIt made me so happy, I went overboard\\nshopping. I don't need this WHITE HERB\\lanymore. Would you take it, please?$"
   },
   "complex": true
  },
  {
   "local_id": 23,
   "x": 27,
   "y": 15,
   "gfx": "OBJ_EVENT_GFX_LITTLE_GIRL_1",
   "movement": "MOVEMENT_TYPE_FACE_DOWN",
   "range": [
    0,
    0
   ],
   "trainer_type": "TRAINER_TYPE_NORMAL",
   "hide_flag": "0",
   "script": "Route104_EventScript_14F25A",
   "texts": {
    "Route104_Text_1B83E9": "GINA: Okay, let's battle with our\\nPOKéMON!$",
    "Route104_Text_1B8414": "GINA: Losing upsets me!$",
    "Route104_Text_1B845C": "GINA: Oh? Only one POKéMON?\\nThen, we don't battle with you.\\pIf there's only one POKéMON, it will\\nbe lonesome. That's not nice.$",
    "Route104_Text_1B842C": "GINA: {STR_VAR_1} is strong!\\nWe have to train lots more!$"
   },
   "complex": true
  },
  {
   "local_id": 24,
   "x": 28,
   "y": 15,
   "gfx": "OBJ_EVENT_GFX_LITTLE_GIRL_1",
   "movement": "MOVEMENT_TYPE_FACE_DOWN",
   "range": [
    0,
    0
   ],
   "trainer_type": "TRAINER_TYPE_NORMAL",
   "hide_flag": "0",
   "script": "Route104_EventScript_14F279",
   "texts": {
    "Route104_Text_1B84DB": "MIA: We are twins, so we battle\\nPOKéMON together.$",
    "Route104_Text_1B850D": "MIA: We battled together, but we\\nboth lost...$",
    "Route104_Text_1B8577": "MIA: You want to battle with us?\\pIt's a big no-no if you don't have two\\nPOKéMON with you.\\lWe're too strong for you!$",
    "Route104_Text_1B853B": "MIA: We will train our POKéMON more\\nand be strong like you.$"
   },
   "complex": true
  },
  {
   "local_id": 25,
   "x": 11,
   "y": 44,
   "gfx": "OBJ_EVENT_GFX_BOY_4",
   "movement": "MOVEMENT_TYPE_FACE_UP_AND_RIGHT",
   "range": [
    0,
    0
   ],
   "trainer_type": "TRAINER_TYPE_NORMAL",
   "hide_flag": "0",
   "script": "Route104_EventScript_14F1DE",
   "texts": {
    "Route104_Text_1B88D4": "Oh, sure, I'll accept your challenge.\\nI have a lot of money.$",
    "Route104_Text_1B8911": "Why couldn't I win?$",
    "Route104_Text_1B8925": "There are some things money can't buy.\\nThat's POKéMON...$"
   },
   "complex": true
  },
  {
   "local_id": 26,
   "x": 22,
   "y": 25,
   "gfx": "OBJ_EVENT_GFX_WOMAN_3",
   "movement": "MOVEMENT_TYPE_ROTATE_COUNTERCLOCKWISE",
   "range": [
    0,
    0
   ],
   "trainer_type": "TRAINER_TYPE_NORMAL",
   "hide_flag": "0",
   "script": "Route104_EventScript_14F21C",
   "texts": {
    "Route104_Text_1B8A24": "We must have been fated to meet.\\nMay I ask you for a battle?$",
    "Route104_Text_1B8A61": "Oh, my!$",
    "Route104_Text_1B8A69": "“Hello” is the beginning of “good-bye.”\\nI hope we meet again.$"
   },
   "complex": true
  },
